# Kite Connect credentials - fill in your real values below.
# This file is already listed in .gitignore (see the "Environment /
# credentials" section) - git will refuse to track it, so it stays on
# this machine only. It will never be pushed to GitHub, and Claude
# will never see its real content when reading this repo.
#
# Real, direct reason this matters: this repository is PUBLIC. A
# credential committed here would be visible to anyone on the
# internet, not just Claude - potentially serious enough to let a
# stranger place orders or pull data on your live Zerodha account.

KITE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
KITE_API_SECRET=your_api_secret_here
